      Device changes

		    SGS-Thomson changed the name of GAL36V18 to GAL6001.

                    The  mnemonic  PC220  was  removed.   Use EP320 as the
                    mnemonic for the Intel 85C220.

                    The incorrectly  listed P20RP10  mnemonic was  removed
                    from the menu.

                    The P1016 family can now correctly simulate the active
                    high common  reset pin.   It previously  was simulated
                    using an active low reset pin.

		    The G20V8A LCC and G16Z8 LCC mnemonics were added.

                    PA7024 support will be available on CUPL-386.

      Mnemonic Revision Changes:

		    Mnemonic  Rev     Description
		    -------- ------   -----------
                    ep1800   rev 09   Corrected AR simulation for buried
                                      nodes.  Added INT for global
                                      macrocells.  Defaulted buried
                                      registers to use synchronous Clock.
                                      Corrected polarity definition of
				      buried registers.
		    ep312    rev 05   Corrected pin 16 combinatorial
				      feedback column number.
		    f18v8z   rev 04   Corrected configuration bits.
		    f20v8    rev 03   Improved mode selection.
		    f30s16   rev 02   Added automatic defaulting of OE
				      terms to 'b'1.
		    f273     rev 02   Corrected total number of fuses.
		    f415     rev 03   Corrected AR and AP default.
				      Corrected buried node feedback.
		    g16v8    rev 09   Changed device to power-up to
				      zero in the registers.
		    g20v8    rev 03   Changed device to power-up to
				      zero in the registers.
		    g22v10   rev 02   Corrected common clock pin.
				      Corrected DOC file fuse map.
		    g6001    rev 13   Corrected feedback polarity of
				      output registers defined as
				      buried nodes.
		    p1016rm4 rev 02   Corrected clocking of registers
				      using all clock pins.
				      Corrected DOC file fuse map.
		    p20cg10  rev 02   Corrected definition of input
				      only on an I/O pin.
		    p20l8lcc rev 09   Corrected DOC file fuse map.
		    p20r6lcc rev 11   Corrected clocking of registers.
		    p20r8lcc rev 10   Corrected DOC file fuse map.
		    p24l10   rev 02   Changed to new specifications.
		    p24r10   rev 02   Changed to new specifications.
		    p26v12   rev 03   Exchanged pins 7(VCC) and 21(GND).
                    p29ma16  rev 11   Corrected AP definition for node 31.
		    p32vx10  rev 10   Corrected pin 16 registered
				      feedback column number.
		    p7c330   rev 05   Improved simulation for IOD.
		    p7c331   rev 04   Corrected total number of fuses.
		    v750lcc  rev 05   Corrected buried node numbers.
				      Corrected DOC file fuse map.
		    v2500    rev 07   Corrected fuse array number for
				      pinnodes 51, 55, 71, 75, 76.
				      Corrected configuration of I/O
				      pins for dedicated input.
		    v2500lcc rev 08   Corrected pin 89 AR array number.

